ng woman in a white jacket sits at a table cluttered with papers, stationery, and drinks."]}, {"rank": 9, "node_id": 70, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 8, "score": 0.18940251931315571, "contents": ["The camera moves back to show a woman seated at the table arranging items inside her bag."]}, {"rank": 10, "node_id": 84, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 9, "score": 0.32691788547291833, "contents": ["The woman is examining an academic curriculum or class schedule belonging to Emma."]}, {"rank": 11, "node_id": 95, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 10, "score": 0.28947573765785367, "contents": ["<face_32> is requesting the robot assistant to file a curriculum paper belonging to someone named Emma into a drawer."]}, {"rank": 12, "node_id": 107, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 11, "score": 0.3351313892891171, "contents": ["The person in the yellow jacket (<voice_96>) enters the apartment and greets the woman sitting at the dining table, identifying her as Emma."]}, {"rank": 13, "node_id": 104, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 11, "score": 0.2947976478717786, "contents": ["The woman in the yellow jacket (<voice_96>) greets Emma while holding a banana and phone."]}, {"rank": 14, "node_id": 117, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 12, "score": 0.3842510162265322, "contents": ["The person wearing the yellow jacket is named Emma, whom the seated woman addresses."]}, {"rank": 15, "node_id": 118, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 12, "score": 0.32896219915720504, "contents": ["Emma complies with the woman's request to throw something into the bin before heading into the bedroom to rest."]}, {"rank": 16, "node_id": 125, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 13, "score": 0.31696436610007317, "contents": ["The woman on the bed is addressed as Emma."]}, {"rank": 17, "node_id": 126, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 13, "score": 0.30733000167107427, "contents": ["The newcomer notices Emma's low mood and asks how she is doing."]}, {"rank": 18, "node