 for afternoon tea."]}, {"rank": 8, "node_id": 15, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 2, "score": 0.33381030495886893, "contents": ["<voice_11> lists available afternoon tea items including coffee, fries, and cakes."]}, {"rank": 9, "node_id": 17, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 2, "score": 0.3106935401216361, "contents": ["<voice_10> checks the time and orders a mocha first."]}, {"rank": 10, "node_id": 18, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 2, "score": 0.15824707962165963, "contents": ["The camera pans towards the wall near the entrance, showing hanging keys and an electric kettle."]}, {"rank": 11, "node_id": 20, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 2, "score": 0.12919687207873387, "contents": ["<voice_11> represents the automated smart home assistant providing menu recommendations."]}, {"rank": 12, "node_id": 13, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 2, "score": 0.10991360449295823, "contents": ["A woman stands near a dining table in an apartment holding a smartphone."]}, {"rank": 13, "node_id": 16, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 2, "score": 0.08947935831499737, "contents": ["<voice_12> responds with an acknowledgment."]}, {"rank": 14, "node_id": 26, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 3, "score": 0.2652394666389675, "contents": ["The woman takes the coffee mug and speaks."]}, {"rank": 15, "node_id": 25, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 3, "score": 0.25452755834020574, "contents": ["The person carries the mug across the room toward a woman seated at a dining table."]}, {"rank": 16, "node_id": 30, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 3, "score": 0.22628541735762397, "contents": ["The person in black gloves prepared and delivered a drink to support the woman while she studied."]}, {"rank": 17, "node_id": 27, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 3, "score": 0.21947373410178725, "contents": ["The woman sips the beverage before setting it down and looking at her smartphone."]}, {"rank": 18, "node_id": 24, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 3, "score": 0.20617919219283676, "contents": ["The person recaps the bottle and picks up the mug."]}, {"rank": 19, "node_id": 22, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 3, "score": 0.17439407364125245, "contents": ["A person wearing black gloves unscrews a bottle of coffee."]}, {"rank": 20, "node_id": 23, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 3, "score": 0.1631582780283067, "contents": ["The person pours the coffee into a white mug on the counter."]}], "query_construction_ms": 0.0017829879652708769, "query_generation_ms": 0.0}], "controller": {"call_count": 0, "each_call_ms": [], "total_ms": 0.0}, "controller_calls": [], "final_answer_call": {"phase": "eval", "question_id": "Q09", "method": "B", "call_id": "21bf5bfb-cbb7-4835-aacc-33acc0a39e36", "purpose": "final_answer", "model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "provider": "302.ai", "request_start": 1789436811.8351552, "ttft_ms": null, "first_response": null, "input_tokens": 373, "output_tokens": 285, "transport": {"client_previously_used": true, "tcp_connect_count": 0, "tls_handshake_count": 0, "http_wall_ms": 2576.020966997021}, "returned_model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "finish_reason": "stop", "response": "The retrieved memories are insufficient to answer when Lily originally needs afternoon tea.", "total_tokens": 658, "request_end": 1789436814.4112604, "latency_ms": 2576.103552011773, "client_wall_clock_latency_ms": 2576.103552011773, "api_request_wall_clock_latency_ms": 2576.103552011773}, "final_answer_model_ms": 2576.103552011773, "FULL_QUESTION_TO_ANSWER_MS": 2839.774342995952, "retrieved_evidence": [{"rank": 1, "node_id": 2, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 1, "score": 0.19333798154930948, "contents": ["She sets her brown backpack down on the bed."]}, {"rank": 2, "node_id": 9, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 1, "score": 0.1675434754878643, "contents": ["<voice_0> belongs to the young woman as she walks through the apartment."]}, {"rank": 3, "node_id": 4, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 1, "score": 0.1660