antic", "timestamp": 14, "score": 0.438384937851479, "contents": ["The woman in the beige top is Emma, who appears upset or troubled."]}, {"rank": 4, "node_id": 164, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 17, "score": 0.4859716857561027, "contents": ["<voice_155>, named Emma, is experiencing emotional distress over academic failure despite having put in sustained effort."]}, {"rank": 5, "node_id": 172, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 18, "score": 0.40598529183318277, "contents": ["<voice_166> reassures her and asks why she failed her course."]}, {"rank": 6, "node_id": 188, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 19, "score": 0.3169452128404582, "contents": ["The woman in the cream sweater expresses concern mixed with reprimand over her friend's lack of caution."]}, {"rank": 7, "node_id": 196, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 20, "score": 0.40973926677973427, "contents": ["The woman on the left is distressed after failing an exam or course."]}, {"rank": 8, "node_id": 215, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 22, "score": 0.41019066096509393, "contents": ["The woman in the beige shirt is upset and demoralized after failing a course in what she considered her best subject."]}, {"rank": 9, "node_id": 221, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 23, "score": 0.3144287811548437, "contents": ["<voice_10> asks if the girl was afraid that she and her mother would be angry with her."]}, {"rank": 10, "node_id": 232, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 24, "score": 0.36507762795382026, "contents": ["<voice_10>, wearing a white sweater and black pants, responds by reassuring her that failing an exam is not the end of the world."]}, {"rank": 11, "node_id": 367, "node_type": "semantic", "timestamp": 37, "score": 0.44691938508558904, "contents": ["<voice_358> expresses admiration and affirmation toward Emma."]}, {"rank": 12, "node_id": 384, "node_type": "episodic", "timestamp": 39, "score": 0.44846073422383637, "contents": ["The woman on the right begins speaking, thanking